{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Catch the Rolling Rice Ball!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">This is a super simple 3D action game. Fight off the enemies and reclaim the rice ball before it gets eaten!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">If you skillfully deflect enemy attacks, you'll enter <strong>Ultra Focus Mode</strong>\u2014time slows down and your speed increases.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Defeating enemies and catching the rice ball quickly will boost your score. Aim for a high score!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The rice ball rolls unpredictably due to physics-based movement\u2014so a bit of luck might be just what you need to catch it! Each stage is short and fast-paced, so you can play again and again.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Cleared stages can be replayed at any time. Try to beat your high score or fastest clear time!</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3868050?t=1752769128","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3868050?t=1752769128","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3868050/3078f3f334adb833e98785161420b131cc41cf74/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1752769128","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3868050/3078f3f334adb833e98785161420b131cc41cf74/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1752769128","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Partial Controller Support","id":18},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Catch the Rolling Rice Ball!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">This is a super simple 3D action game. Fight off the enemies and reclaim the rice ball before it gets eaten!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">If you skillfully deflect enemy attacks, you'll enter <strong>Ultra 